<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Thank You – Kwizera Charity Foundation</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background-color: #1a6b3c; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .body { padding: 36px 40px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; }
    .body p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
    .highlight { background: #f0f9f4; border-left: 4px solid #1a6b3c; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { background-color: #f9f9f9; border-top: 1px solid #ececec; padding: 20px 40px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888888; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Kwizera Charity Foundation</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Dear <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Thank you for reaching out to Kwizera Charity Foundation. We have received your interest in sponsoring a child and truly appreciate your generosity.</p>
      <div class="highlight">
        Our team will review your inquiry and contact you shortly with available sponsorship opportunities and next steps.
      </div>
      <p>Your support makes a real difference in the lives of children and families in our communities. Together, we can provide education, healthcare, and hope.</p>
      <p>Warm regards,<br /><strong>Kwizera Charity Foundation Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; {{year}} Kwizera Charity Foundation &bull; hello@vnbcoffee.com
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
